# ============================================================================
# NOTES
# ============================================================================
# This .gitignore file is designed to exclude:
# 1. Sensitive data (secrets, credentials, personal data)
# 2. Generated files (build artifacts, logs, caches)
# 3. Environment-specific configurations
# 4. IDE and OS specific files
# 5. Temporary and backup files
#
# Always review before committing to ensure no sensitive data is included.
# Use git-secrets or similar tools to prevent accidental commits of secrets.


